## Your responsibility when you run this code

This code fetches data from third-party websites and generates marketing copy.

- **Terms of service.** You are responsible for complying with the terms of
  service, `robots.txt`, and any applicable law for every site you point this
  code at. Prefer an official API or a licensed data feed wherever one exists.
- **Fair housing.** The screening function included here is a limited safety
  net, **not legal advice**. Fair housing law in the United States is enforced
  by HUD and by state agencies. A human must review every piece of marketing
  copy before publication.
- **Data protection.** Do not use this code to collect or process personal data
  you are not lawfully entitled to hold.

